msgid ""
"The following section provides a couple of common usage scenarios for "
"MAVProxy."
msgstr "以下章节提供了 MAVProxy 的几个常见使用场景。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/examples.rst:7
#: 25cdf1d30c1741869590f341bc4d1d43
msgid ""
"Quadcopter over a standard (57600 kbps) radio link on a serial port. "
"MAVProxy will auto-detect the correct serial port. The quadcopter is called "
"\"Quaddy\". The GUI console, map and text-to-speech are also enabled:"
msgstr ""
"通过标准串口上的无线电链路（57600 kbps）连接四旋翼飞行器。MAVProxy 将自动检测正确的串口。四旋翼飞行器命名为 "
"「Quaddy」，同时启用 GUI 控制台、地图和语音播报："

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/examples.rst:13
#: 3cb705da55ce4a769d5a6d59dc69641e
msgid ""
"Run MAVProxy in daemon mode, taking in a radio link (COM17 at 9600 kbps) and"
" outputting it to the local network. This allows a single instance of "
"MAVProxy to distribute the telemetry stream to multiple clients:"
msgstr ""
"以守护进程模式运行 MAVProxy，接收无线电链路输入（COM17，9600 kbps）并将其输出到本地网络。这允许单个 MAVProxy "
"实例将数传流分发给多个客户端："

